{"title":"2024 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2024 AMC 10A #2</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2024 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2024 AMC 12A #2</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Central_Valley_Math_Circle\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Central Valley Math Circle</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Math_from_my_desk\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Math from my desk</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(🚀_2_min_solve_🚀)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (🚀 2 min solve 🚀)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Power_Solve\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Power Solve</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_FrankTutor\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by FrankTutor</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Dr._David\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Dr. David</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_yjtest\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">15</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by yjtest</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#Video_solution_by_TheNeuralMathAcademy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">16</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#Video_solution_by_MaffyTaffy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">17</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video solution by MaffyTaffy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">18</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A model used to estimate the time it will take to hike to the top of the mountain on a trail is of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/d/b6d135980870b4364048215a8579f3f00bda2113.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T=aL+bG,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"111\" height=\"18\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are constants, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2554b6496c3b678897e9b060ef00aa9f0a7d7ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> is the time in minutes, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> is the length of the trail in miles, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e28ce12d49d39f160d5a0ef54077fc98e4b9d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is the altitude gain in feet. The model estimates that it will take <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/0/a80952a9a250e7257f7c6d64e763dae189dbb271.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$69$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes to hike to the top if a trail is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/7/15788e198a53ced87268aea78fcde68a84de92c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> miles long and ascends <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/7/557a9700315ffdc6da28316197f148da6ee2a3ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$800$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> feet, as well as if a trail is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/9/499e5d3fb13c7f899257773b0a1b7ebfc699d001.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" /> miles long and ascends <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/c/57c304fcf196b7b1f16c5153a5e33a12979ee260.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1100$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> feet. How many minutes does the model estimates it will take to hike to the top if the trail is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/c/55cd5096fdf88f4158d342806f650704472f9a96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4.2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" /> miles long and ascends <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/0929ed034079c23455c385741744274c1f69b61b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4000$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> feet?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/e/d7e2252ee25aa3c3e2a5a2d1dd0e311c793d8b4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }240\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }246\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }252\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }258\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }264$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"446\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plug in the values into the equation to give you the following two equations:\n\\begin{align*}\n69&amp;=1.5a+800b, \\\\\n69&amp;=1.2a+1100b.\n\\end{align*}\nSolving for the values <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> gives you that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/9/03962071fc4c9b65e59ed9e27f612398dbdfcd1f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"54\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/6/7568019a2bd35cbc477d07c88fa26837e723cea6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=\\frac{3}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"65\" height=\"38\" />. These values can be plugged back in showing that these values are correct.\nNow, using the given length of the trail, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/c/55cd5096fdf88f4158d342806f650704472f9a96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4.2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" />, and the given vertical increase, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/0929ed034079c23455c385741744274c1f69b61b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4000$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> , we get a final answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/c/b1ca083e42f011aef46a0c0754318920a9b86dad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }246}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>Solution by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Juwushu\" title=\"User:Juwushu\">juwushu</a>.\n</p><p>Minor edits by ParticlePhysics and TigerSenju\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Alternatively, observe that using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/5/1b52b632e7051403932dec5ce3eb3d67f79fb0ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=10x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/986f97d5de9069a2b2a540933fa1db7f826b5103.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=\\frac{y}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"65\" height=\"34\" /> makes the numbers much closer to each other in terms of magnitude.\n</p><p>Plugging in the new variables:\n\\begin{align*}\n69&amp;=15x+8y, \\\\\n69&amp;=12x+11y.\n\\end{align*}\n</p><p>The solution becomes more obvious in this way, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/6/de67788798514d080e356016782bb6c6da990956.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15+8=12+11=23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"177\" height=\"15\" />, and since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/8/a185c636b2c4da45c5151701dd56f4ef26708eee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$23\\cdot 3=69$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"14\" />, we determine that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/6/0467873364c214e26580ec0b177e95c5284fc746.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=y=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"79\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>The question asks us for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/5/0651dabe4d939bfc3962e686175c2af19dede306.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4.2a+4000b=42x+40y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"204\" height=\"18\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/1/0110f1bb04c51b2a4d431bf14489fc1b48b37421.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"11\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/a/30aab7711f542be4632da663b524ed4c7fe7c358.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(40+42)\\cdot 3=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }246}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"194\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/W0NMzXaULx4\">https://youtu.be/W0NMzXaULx4</a>\n</p><p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_DDM\">Video Solution by DDM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by DDM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/WQPvU95GSBU\">https://youtu.be/WQPvU95GSBU</a>\n</p><p>~piggydude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/l3VrUsZkv8I\">https://youtu.be/l3VrUsZkv8I</a>\n~MC\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Central_Valley_Math_Circle\">Video Solution by Central Valley Math Circle</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Central Valley Math Circle\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/UewevLQ9qqE\">https://youtu.be/UewevLQ9qqE</a>\n</p><p>~mr_mathman\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math_from_my_desk\">Video Solution by Math from my desk</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Math from my desk\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ENbD-tbfbhU&amp;t=2s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ENbD-tbfbhU&amp;t=2s</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28.F0.9F.9A.80_2_min_solve_.F0.9F.9A.80.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(🚀_2_min_solve_🚀)\">Video Solution (🚀 2 min solve 🚀)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (🚀 2 min solve 🚀)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/OmaG3iG7xFs\">https://youtu.be/OmaG3iG7xFs</a>\n</p><p><i>~Education, the Study of Everything</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Power_Solve\">Video Solution by Power Solve</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Power Solve\">edit<