fIEibA?t=540\">https://youtu.be/zaswZfIEibA?t=540</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Dr._David\">Video Solution by Dr. David</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Dr. David\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/mrlTB_0QNyI\">https://youtu.be/mrlTB_0QNyI</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_yjtest\">Video Solution by yjtest</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=15\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by yjtest\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kyDHwV_KEy4\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kyDHwV_KEy4</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_solution_by_TheNeuralMathAcademy\">Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=16\" title=\"Edit section: Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4b_YLnyegtw&amp;t=158s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4b_YLnyegtw&amp;t=158s</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_solution_by_MaffyTaffy\">Video solution by MaffyTaffy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp